a70bc17\"},{\"tab_title\":\"V\\u0130ZYON\",\"tab_content\":\"<div><p>LUFLY \\u0130N\\u015eAAT SANAY\\u0130, in\\u015faat sekt\\u00f6r\\u00fcnde yap\\u0131 malzemeleri ve ticaret \\u00e7\\u00f6z\\u00fcmleri sa\\u011flayan \\u00f6nde gelen bir kurulu\\u015f olmay\\u0131 hedeflemektedir. M\\u00fckemmeliyet, g\\u00fcvenilirlik ve yenilik konusundaki ba\\u011fl\\u0131l\\u0131\\u011f\\u0131m\\u0131zla tan\\u0131nmay\\u0131 ve sekt\\u00f6rde yeni \\u00f6l\\u00e7\\u00fctler belirlemeyi\\u00a0ama\\u00e7l\\u0131yoruz.<\\/p><\\/div>\",\"_id\":\"3054366\"}],\"tabs_align_horizontal\":\"center\",\"__globals__\":{\"tab_active_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=base1\",\"tab_color\":\"\",\"border_color\":\"\",\"background_color\":\"\"},\"tab_typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"tab_typography_font_size_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":18,\"sizes\":[]},\"tab_active_color\":\"#2457aa\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"tabs\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"abf02e1\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"gap\":\"no\",\"margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":0,\"bottom\":\"80\",\"left\":0,\"isLinked\":false},\"margin_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":0,\"bottom\":\"50\",\"left\":0,\"isLinked\":false},\"margin_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"\",\"right\":0,\"bottom\":\"\",\"left\":0,\"isLinked\":true}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"e0b9e45\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null,\"space_between_widgets\":0,\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"15\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"margin_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"15\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"padding_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"10\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"padding_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":true}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"bd13fab\",\"elTy