(1917, 1, '2024-10-29 20:19:53', '2024-10-29 20:19:53', '<h3>About this item</h3>\r\nEnjoy your cup full of relaxing coffee with this beautifully crafted ceramic coffee mug. This purple ceramic mug is a pure delight for coffee lovers but doesn’t disappoint other drinkers at all. You can use this big size cup for enjoying not just coffee but also other drinks like milk, hot chocolate or even can be used as a comfortable soup bowl. The ergonomic shape and sturdy handle on this large coffee mug makes it more than convenient for enjoying any of your favorite drinks. This is very durable, safe, high temperature resistant, no fading, oven and micro safe coffee mugs.\r\n\r\nThis jumbo mug has a capacity of 450 ml and is spacious enough to hold sufficient quantity of your drinks. This large mug is made from high quality ceramic and then both the inner and outer walls are glazed and hand painted to give it a classy shinny finish. These oven bowl set microwave are very easy to clean you can wash them by hand in hot water with soap or put them in the dishwasher as convenient. They also work well in a microwave without getting too hot.\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-832\" src=\"http://lufly.tr/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/products-banner-1-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1600\" height=\"600\" />\r\n\r\nThis most amazing thing about this hand painted coffee mug is that it can be used by any age group. The elegant look and design make it suitable for adults as home and office coffee mug while the cute purple color make it a perfect coffee or milk cup for kids.\r\n\r\nThis full size mug can be a perfect option as a gift for kids as well as adults. No matter what the occasion is, this coffee mug gift will surely bring a smile on the face of your loved ones.', 'Ceramic Vase Flowers Pot Arrangements Bunch', 'The right dinner set is as significant as the right recipe. It supplements an opulent feel to your dining space. A sophisticated set of dinnerware sets the right mood, thereby enhancing your dining experience.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '270-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-10-29 20:19:53', '2024-10-29 20:19:53', '', 270, 'https://lufly.tr/?p=1917', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
